{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:6627dc239de84d543f0814439a5c628c77fe9dd8ec762af34f0bc668cedc481e",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4fccffb8779505cf38ba733d956e61bfe1e282272ffb678f921a1a9c9994de2e",
      "text": "追寻生命的音色",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a973df57caa06b84a42d5f715127e366b75cbf839ca6ad7e5b5ae3e4ca9abd8",
      "text": "开始考虑偶像这条道路的圭，\n茫然地回顾着至今为止的人生。\n另一方面，丽继续在别墅疗养，心情却\n依然没有放晴。在此期间，他回想起了几天前\n遇到的那个人，以及他们之间的交谈……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_a:cmd-000014:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3a0c7f8f83c9759bf38e90e810580beff52236c88683724b5c13d354d17d97d",
      "text": "第3话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_a:cmd-000014:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4fccffb8779505cf38ba733d956e61bfe1e282272ffb678f921a1a9c9994de2e",
      "text": "追寻生命的音色",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48fd7210c58888bbbd823e99d02fd26e4a6cf45b9c57b51b42340be560248de6",
      "text": "……你还记得那个递名片给我的人吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_a:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13f6484ff88c37ef373452c7ecc7ca194aa935b37078beda420a726f1997fd06",
      "text": "嗯？记得啊……怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a5d3d671a4599a12211016b4b706bea5c2d7716d19087f1f908f8251859910e",
      "text": "那个邀请，我想接受试试看。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1eaa6ff967872a771e04c6ef8c415e424761a14688df83741c62d926069f5247",
      "text": "……！这样啊，挺好的不是吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51276bccfa8a5f2be74343443a1371acb61def5b89364106b862aa7b1d1ddc08",
      "text": "那个人，似乎在我的歌声中发现了某种可能性。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0f90fdbd8eaa6d8fb2da492d24a3c457146b3e0b6b0a5cd5cb00384c5d74428",
      "text": "因为他和你一样热心……\n我觉得稍微回应一下也未尝不可。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_a:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55001e154a1e7e1fd394fc329871cd8171c9934a079ab81a672dfe5de4c069c6",
      "text": "圭的歌声就是有着那么强烈的吸引力啊。\n那么，跟给名片的人联络过了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de2f10d758bb1f3165fcf3ab70bde900d3e68d36629e8d63d4324751010c901e",
      "text": "嗯。听说必须要参加试镜。\n今天打算去听听说明。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_a:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38d372e5f9fdbaa4ad82205b041b0401eb28104d9bd0271a4ff91faec75b3b6e",
      "text": "你的话绝对能合格的。\n……不过，没想到你真的会付诸行动。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dde5952da22b4fb21c0ea7ec7bb076d4fdf8148feb70c59a6e7ead337a157972",
      "text": "我一直都很担心你啊。就是……看着自相识以来\n变得越来越没有生气的你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_a:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d437c9d1c9b18830022f5564cd617e84b51b93ffcd5fc7f72426fbbb8584082",
      "text": "总觉得你哪天甚至会说着连活着都嫌麻烦，\n然后不知所踪……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_a:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b9116a9e717092c76dd368010342018c76c55ab45cd29225ee7e32845e2fd6d",
      "text": "……呵呵，是吗。\n那我出门了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_a:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6bde6a9a565d8e92589f7185f512b1d5c4dad5f93a9292d313257328c9421df",
      "text": "（越来越没有生气，吗……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_a:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42673bdaff6404f7b728091a2937d186e0cc65b5238ff4ebb4690b74a902b831",
      "text": "（虽然是自己的事，但这也是\n变成这样也无可厚非的人生啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8cc0803e4b002645044ce6067a83897ae0dc9f5553ccb27dec59fb2af644512f",
      "text": "伴随着你的钢琴声歌唱，\n这段时间真的好幸福。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4569957912562662c645a23d0657488296d1baae17a34f912f93ade148251a51",
      "text": "啊啊，是啊。\n可以的话，我想唱一整天。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8302bef1f17108952f0fc61d2f5f7d101c38a04631a9e13f02bcdff76648bab3",
      "text": "……在德国那段贫穷又寂寞的日子里，\n是你给予了我名为音乐的光芒。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:826b861a3a9ee676ca1247fc4c6b42dd8359483292a4557d3ee6d62da012017d",
      "text": "简直就像天使一样呢……\n真希望这样的日子能一直持续下去啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97aed6163fa4a18bb601e3aaeb9d0026d3e855083b7d3b736923a557c4d2837f",
      "text": "怎么了吗？\n不继续弹了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_b:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45f6b250440d7fff2728663aab7ce0a675178c9591069d4bafc9f6d7f3f8cf62",
      "text": "不会持续下去……\n那是什么意思……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_c:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54d2c8e8e6abbd88ca5da26cef10b3ae8d3b786cdc142ce03917659f1bb7dc06",
      "text": "……妈妈。\n连你也要抛下我离去吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87728c9c7c05be626395829deb2a2d35e2100c83e06880f8c2f8a8eee636a832",
      "text": "（她直到最后，\n都未能摆脱酒精的囚禁）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_c:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e263be0e71e345f3c37eac53c62d8222ddf91472f62e85a7a43372b9fe9ea3f3",
      "text": "（凭我，无法拯救她的心灵……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_c:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:313602d18946628b34217724a91c36f414d673bc34de07ed903bbb349cccf742",
      "text": "即便如此，你还是深爱着我，挂念着我呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_c:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77ff06484ffdbe8632dd81eec3c616cc6409173cd7e15ae20d3eee9360c8c215",
      "text": "谢谢你。\n和你在这个房间里度过的每一天，我很幸福哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2217e90fcbaa4027b9899802dd49d7e7fb9beeb6b47246b2787fa374e0685f0",
      "text": "正因如此……真想和你再多待一阵子啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3875fe8ffed2bae1e09de9264cbffa5b7b44614d6b607bac3926a580c4a1d00e",
      "text": "（自那一天起，我的天使便消失了踪影。\n与妈妈也再也无法相见了……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_c:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:82d2b5858e67a55a29e98de28e8e175b60847afb51653dfc0e2ea216856ed42c",
      "text": "珍贵的事物，全都会……\n轻易地消失不见呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_c:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be9a7e6099c243472b2d9a70ef51bdf73b570f6f0c03c1a54f54435a2a652e5e",
      "text": "（好安静。我的心，还有世界……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_c:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2c249bf1e14ac39302097ba856e5c3ba2da4b38db8a2a0f69c719b799fa98a4",
      "text": "……圭。能聊聊吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_d:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1f10b2fbb2a108898b5ac9d6546a592d8628cda4cfaa8ce206f45b806379590",
      "text": "其实，在你母亲去世前不久，\n我们就在考虑了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_d:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64525b2eefabf398097953d8e11bb9a22ec129796293bfc1eee8fc1c5392679b",
      "text": "今后我们两个人，\n打算去养老院受人照料了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_d:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6046f80c3dafe28a7143d7d596e764339815187e9b96c174d197191aff1df9d",
      "text": "……这样啊。会变得很寂寞呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_d:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9fb658ae5117abc0d64eee59122cc2a4d1b316d24a3ae9b49072aff7bf6842a0",
      "text": "女儿还在世时我们还硬撑着，\n但我们毕竟已经上了年纪。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_d:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8545e5d398de7bf8033c07a8940d4f22de65b4422641c13d3da439ceb1e0adc8",
      "text": "圭。你还年轻，我们希望你能自由地生活。\n有想去的地方，或是想做的事情吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7e049e5319e627c92e5a91100ff58ed7d7b19f38288dc1d4f8595a773389972",
      "text": "……我打算离开德国，去日本。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_d:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42c75872679eddce4db10c71ee20284575d9a9bc7e23f2e0fbfaa26aebcad513",
      "text": "认识的日本留学生，\n邀请我和他一起做作曲的工作。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_d:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:efb1f4656205014b94ac19fcc5f82539e18dc8d692461e93471c2f4536bc2b63",
      "text": "无论你想做什么我们都支持你。\n即使相隔遥远，我们也会一直挂念着你的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_d:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6ef7b419e8b30ba22ddbf48d48504d55fc34a217e882fdebe6ed497049d95d5",
      "text": "谢谢你们二位。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_d:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8fae318e4820216ed726e075823c93f7fd08b003d9bcd56fb01832c3cd7489b",
      "text": "……日本吗。对你来说算是回国了吧。\n小时候在那里生活过吧？还记得吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_d:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8df84301945e1516afe872be4c1a19d99fec67a46bef45acfcfcf1f973b15d90",
      "text": "……和当初来德国时一样哦。\n哪怕什么都不懂，也只是活下去而已。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_e:cmd-000012:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f41789a3f975725f965b9e44a78df3c090c2e74399319f3374cc0492972ca458",
      "text": "数年后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_e:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9a9d79c5e0e51756e8a57ab0777985feab6ffdaf41f7ea216564a77d821219d",
      "text": "（啊啊……今天也，\n度过了一段多么美妙的时光啊！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce67507cc0c9f21efa4646cd8767dc783482799bc805f8bdcb2eb4d65a700960",
      "text": "（只要由她唱出来，我的曲子就被注入了灵魂）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_e:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d846ad85657d393ab0fc2af7b7b4eea3112a42e0ff5cf6ce6bec6869ef445bec",
      "text": "（仿佛连身为作曲者的我都未能见识到的世界，\n都被她的歌声唤醒了一般……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_e:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3c53e7e490ba48f5d535f9c99b709e2453d8c0d701b5ac9ea4eb11c2e91be55",
      "text": "今后也能……\n继续由她来演唱我的曲子就好了……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_e:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ca2711e3e7bb028492890788032c79fcce1a7ca7db311e06cb0d79198c67997",
      "text": "……各位，我有重要的事情要宣布。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_e:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aba371969052c1d5a37bb24d6b2f62e58396bc450ecfb5c3e120b695294c9ce0",
      "text": "我将以今天为限，辞去偶像的工作。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_e:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c660af88f68f5023c73232ff3579aa14248320c455c491534b58bf5d9af7cce",
      "text": "我找到了比歌唱更重要的东西……\n我想和心爱的人一起，过属于自己的人生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_e:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52c00a6aa1bd9b9eecf4534d3b93daa22095eaace27324c3ab2af77720ed6c8d",
      "text": "……你已经不打算再唱了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_e:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7cfdeed4853a1b17a563c3b12a91006c66096ebf70213f1afc0e68650b6bcbc8",
      "text": "……是的。但是，能够成为偶像……\n能够演唱都筑先生的曲子，我感到非常幸福。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_e:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2be9648de3bb43d4f8159fae913eeecd5d0ab973d862ad55a43de7a3caf1383",
      "text": "我心目中世界上最美妙的音乐，\n永远是老师制作的音乐。无论是过去，还是将来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_e:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1e606cd86b4f58f3f7fbd99b7eca5268f3757a0d67627d97a8d02e4a7b8405e",
      "text": "即使如此……要是没有了你……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_f:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:644ef8e61c5e2766ef04652bbc418c483e7bc22878871c28340ff2bcb25044fd",
      "text": "要是她不唱了，我也不再作曲了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_f:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c596b80eae245f7fc63ddb89be94ecb09b9f4223ef163e4bf3b5f1e68db9d789",
      "text": "圭，你是认真的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_f:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4de9ec64c81150bd8c3a526d31ad55e59f314d1164af5e801f4d356464e8a91d",
      "text": "你拥有着特殊的才能。\n就算没有她，只要继续做音乐的话……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_f:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a82508322f2548365a9a89cd23f4d63158aa18fd1f2b8ec5adfa6c3d0fc35041",
      "text": "唔……够了。别说了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_f:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62b6a598ffd49eed92641099a5db55a5abe7c82214bd8e6fb0f0b747621f719b",
      "text": "我的音乐，没有她的声音就动不起来。\n逝去的生命……再也无法回来了……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_f:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5195a7145e5a2a1c873253c985fd294ef1feec79609848de63ecc257e90ecf4",
      "text": "（……无论在德国还是在日本，\n都在反复不断地失去着）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_f:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cdbf8c9b0ffbde115d7ba41abeff5d7eee62be50ea157754a34f3ba521082fed",
      "text": "要是我成了偶像，\n又会产生珍贵的事物吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_f:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b29a2b43ec11e2cf0cb8ad6b724572432f14e5283a2a3b14a92cb610be728132",
      "text": "（而那些事物，也会以同样的方式失去吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_f:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89196b1f2f5950b6d452601b61ba5680d2bdcff3afe4c588a2c2f56ad2e786f7",
      "text": "……差不多到时间了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_g:cmd-000011:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c01665e106af1c7f94e7b95f4ffd4a216fb9a48dc18728eb87b212c673307013",
      "text": "……♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_g:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e583dd657d816ef7f2e5a41a40e56c8aef7595c925e101837c3616839df80fd1",
      "text": "（只要独自一人，就能随心所欲地演奏。\n但是，一回想起那一天的景象……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_g:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:420505f1d02ef16dae32f5c34abe8b07db51b2367f93bc4c908fe9756d3d51fe",
      "text": "唔……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_g:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b21aa2697b77b8c9ccb572eeb2d1f2af503bb0f045bcc344c87d7cddb51b7a8",
      "text": "（我难道已经只能在空无一人的地方，\n演奏音乐了吗……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_g:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd1fe08595b8a1efda820a1ce24e83f758a0fdb5898aa38dffb03244c6dd5536",
      "text": "呜……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_g:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f6c719a1bad94b69ac2b560d308764ac0a9d8bd0df2f491788ad81acda518f5",
      "text": "阿尔托，你在安慰我吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_g:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:519f4fc6f661f136896f78a2802108cb2bbe43b1c00f887a9ae8a6eeceb3537c",
      "text": "汪！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_g:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01e07109054c2868ca5d226887b26abccb8c0fe33da8915c856218b06988c4a6",
      "text": "呵呵。谢谢你。\n今天就把小提琴收起来，好好休息吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_g:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8610c4c46ac7419781401cd832d1b5903a6a142bb755a4429dac6a7d20ce59c",
      "text": "……哎，名片……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_g:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e15411b7a83c794dff9b3de5be66bdd3d3e94703ad67b63092e4ee49caf9a38a",
      "text": "……“315 Production”吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_h:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3fd5a9db311f069ed95c1b3141382d751814f016788f0b1736915bfe93a1ef6",
      "text": "您的琴声深深打动了我。\n我相信，整个世界一定都在期盼着这份感动。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_h:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98fab70581b3fa48f037cdcccd2d953ad5777a17baa54436b57b238b8f961b50",
      "text": "您愿意和我一起，去把感动传递给大家吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_h:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9c32056bcb1635a7002c496c69ac7b3d828f3ca044d2d4b19d381e495857c8a",
      "text": "……“一起”……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_h:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b014a10bcbdf08a293260e3150e068d48444ef51af7a38d709f6eaa0433c1e1b",
      "text": "（迄今为止，曾有许多人向我抛出橄榄枝）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_h:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07a25e006fd72317e8d2c3b5cdf3e612eb2c3b70b43079d9d5d17e1c7c5a9c45",
      "text": "（但那只是想利用神乐丽的音乐……\n不，只是想利用我那能换来金钱的名号罢了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_h:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83ab0e4f41306e17c1f514d8cd7ba58d5af8955fc3b14158df1b0e3ecfbf94d5",
      "text": "……从没有哪怕一个人，\n说过要“一起”传递出去呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_h:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47e49fa161832b39f5d5e02ee24a0dde4d302a1d3fbbe02b4e7b660eb7e6ea08",
      "text": "汪汪！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_h:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f64f625cd04c957c642d4b4ace979ae34fc1b4009cdeccf752f94db1d4261d4d",
      "text": "啊，阿尔托。\n快把名片还给我。那个是……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_h:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3957fa8fd306c94103cd225aa10df21c984b707963610b63ce08790e3208266",
      "text": "……很重要的东西，所以……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_h:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10b80d7860ffb377884f277d709683684b85d9455f4d4aefa85b786a3e5a2cc1",
      "text": "（……说出口之后，我明白了。\n我其实对这次相遇抱有期待）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_h:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a47ad544050d01ff5aa0ba17db95168d849257b75cf926c0441f72324adbef5d",
      "text": "（我不想在这里放弃。我想把自己的音乐，\n传达给某个人，并被人所需要……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_h:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b7fe9396e30d02f808c9b6aaeadcc1b5b62db669677e5d8d643eadef40d8100",
      "text": "……喂，深夜打扰实在抱歉。\n我是之前收下阁下名片的神乐丽。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_i:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4a60fff3cf6e91e52a3fecb6cb56357fa119475fc4cec59476327327d7e9f0a",
      "text": "那么，我来为您说明一下今后的日程安排。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_i:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d832e6e0d6b0f1f8622730df01daec143da9cc27e117d5c1527611dd7013aa20",
      "text": "首先是前几天和您提过的，\n请您参加试镜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_i:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c8f17c3e62238de4a51d811a97da8407ff3ad1754b0fdbe3fe6ce4b2cec3f0f",
      "text": "就在那里，让大家见识一下圭先生的光芒吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_i:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7de8f5a994989a7f004655fa218278afa41de82ac208a18f1f420a3c794b3594",
      "text": "嗯，我知道了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_i:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5753f1569696acf96810f3285665f06f6e3474cd43ffac7f4d58888a25ae713",
      "text": "也许会有紧张的时候，\n但只要和平时一样就好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_i:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b3e004991a600bd3cd75ab7bb80eebb56f90718e1382cef91b47fa09b8f9495",
      "text": "这样一来，圭先生的优点一定能传达给大家的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_i:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bdf185571f33ef8d07fb03365ae46031074aaafeb7b1c9612e94fc9fc65a186f",
      "text": "能那样就太好了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_i:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc00d4fa836c2bc26777261a117e874a2137c4c942b127a5d60909945fbcde93",
      "text": "（他愿意参加试镜真是太好了。\n圭先生一定会成为非常出色的偶像！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_i:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8e7fde8d1a767120e364840329ca4d0273c328746224295241bb16ca1e2a2d7",
      "text": "那个，我可以问一个问题吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_j:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88d594151c1c545134d480f6ab01197875b7faef5f6938395ea4a0346be0e970",
      "text": "试镜合格之后，\n我是要一个人当偶像吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_j:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fd1d82e58875e9ba3fe14e67526b9d96242db51d7f09af94f9714224b6caff5",
      "text": "无论是个人还是组合，\n偶像应该有各种各样的形式吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_j:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd77bd9c66990ca9067c274616b125292567c233292c98841e5725e790a8ae2f",
      "text": "是的。315 Production目前\n确实是以组合活动为主。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_j:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c966e0c3cd93f7c50b91986a5169c386e2d99b058a31822ec09ec8edadf17f94",
      "text": "不过，根据本人的意愿和适应性，\n我们也会考虑个人活动的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_j:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65da2acfd9b615549dd1a18b51fd98faab8f10b208c389c771fa8c1dafc2bd6a",
      "text": "这样啊。那就好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_j:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6864a782a4756c46d44f40b954c5c81688fa169518ce0da23a0ff8efcf17db97",
      "text": "您希望以个人身份活动吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_j:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea2effe7afb5650af036a7054d36d5bf8c20739ef03d32cf65eba920fc11b249",
      "text": "嗯……也是呢……\n因为我并不擅长配合别人的步调。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_j:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af2692fb8ee6d37d7da10e2425a7a98763d018f8f182e8e7fe3b3e1361da6ffb",
      "text": "我也经常给寄宿处的友人夫妇添麻烦。\n要是和我组成搭档，那个人一定会很辛苦吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_j:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64e0dab4463b6077a0632ffbab3044a41263dc36e6d0cbfc10ae2db6cb7706f6",
      "text": "您有什么期望吗？比如\n希望能和什么样的人组队。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_03_1_1_003_03:1_1_003_03_j:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5867b35d0f11ddf5a2a45651e0683b62483039bd1bb37a6ababcbf2121d26ff4",
      "text": "那个嘛……",
